## What is not distributed

- No Hisense/VIDAA firmware, launcher bundle (`app.js`), generated `home.js`,
  cobalt cache, backup tarball or other OEM/vendor bytes.
- No app icons, wallpapers, channel logos or other third-party artwork.
- No credentials, pairing tokens, device serial numbers or LAN addresses beyond
  the example defaults in the scripts.
- No root, file-bridge or exploit tooling.

The build combines the upstream wrappers with **your own** copy of the stock
launcher. The result contains vendor code and is intended for your own TV only.
Do not commit or redistribute it.

